<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-ananassae-turing-wavelength-s0-code-traceability> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Drosophila ananassae Turing wavenumber at 2.1 µm (Holocene, 0 Ma) — Code-to-model traceability: 80/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Jacobian, onset k, fastest mode, and the chronospecies λ² diffusivity scaling are each a named function. The Lean file states the same nanometre wavelengths and the milli-unit h-condition. Comments name Turing 1952 and Schnakenberg 1979; they do not pin equation numbers inside those papers." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-code-traceability> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/code-traceability" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-ananassae-turing-wavelength-s0-code-traceability-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-ananassae-turing-wavelength-s0-code-traceability-2> ;
    pk:hasScore 8e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-ananassae-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Drosophila ananassae Turing wavenumber at 2.1 µm (Holocene, 0 Ma) — Model fidelity to source: 82/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "The script integrates the Schnakenberg PDE and selects k_c as argmax Re σ(k), with Du fixed by the onset formula at the design wavenumber. Parameters belong to this 2.1 µm slot. The equal-diffusion check is only on the linear symbol, not on an integrated field." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-ananassae-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-ananassae-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity-2> ;
    pk:hasScore 8.2e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-ananassae-turing-wavelength-s0-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Drosophila ananassae Turing wavenumber at 2.1 µm (Holocene, 0 Ma) — Morphometric validation: 58/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "The saturated FFT wavelength is 2.030 µm against the analytic 2.106 µm, so the two numbers are not copies of each other. Plate circularity is 0.136 against a circle null of 1, and aspect ratio is 2.02. Pearson r, RMSE, and KS across a sweep are not computed." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
